[1.401246, "o", "\r\n\r\n>>>\r\n>>> Final boundary test: temporarily expand sudo so the automation identity is allowed to\r\n>>> call semodule. If sudo were the real boundary, this would remove a deny module.\r\n>>> Blastwall should stop it inside SELinux instead.\r\n>>>\r\n\r\n"]
